# Issue #514 row 2: an audio-only call pads on the audio SSRC (no RTX), each padding packet the bytes
# the pacer asked for clamped to [50, min(max payload, 255)] (PaddingBytesInPacket, rtp_sender.cc:150-160),
# so the sizes vary with the request. Before, the pacer sent fixed 224-byte placeholders (2 sizes with the
# 102-byte probe start).
# libwebrtc on audio_only_lossy seed 1: 851 padding packets of 25 sizes, 104-303 bytes on the wire
# (parity-data traces).
name issue_514_audio_padding
describe Audio-only padding sized by RTPSender::GeneratePadding, as libwebrtc's
duration 30s
seed 1
video off
at 0s capacity=500kbps delay=40ms jitter=10ms loss=10%
expect net.padding_media_ssrc_packets > 0
expect net.padding_distinct_sizes > 4
